      "difficulty": "Core",
      "skill": "support-conclusions",
      "prompt": "To write (−1, −√3) in polar coordinates, a student computes r = 2 and θ = arctan(−√3/−1) = arctan(√3) = π/3, and gives (2, π/3). Which of the following is the best response?",
